{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践与生产部署","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"training-infrastructure","title":"训练基础设施与分布式系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/training-infrastructure","wordCount":1528,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation-debugging","title":"评估调试与策略诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/evaluation-debugging","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"production-deployment","title":"生产部署与在线服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/production-deployment","wordCount":1905,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 工程实践与生产部署\n\n本章覆盖将 RL 算法从研究原型推向生产系统的全链路工程实践：训练基础设施（分布式训练、显存优化、数据管线）、评估与调试（离线评估方法、奖励黑客检测、策略诊断工具）、以及生产部署（推理优化、AB 测试、在线监控与安全护栏）。\n\n这些工程知识是区分\"论文能复现\"与\"产品能上线\"的关键差异所在，也是 RL 工程师的核心竞争力。\n"}